            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The module includes the use of energy and auxiliary materials for the operation of lighting, storage and drying of roughage, dung scraper, slurry agitator, milking machine, milk cooling, cleaning, drinking water. The functional unit is 1 livestock unit (LU) during 1 year.;
UUID: fcd2c97e-1b18-3b95-98b2-31a05b164293</common:generalComment>
